This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.

Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   The user's session spans multiple phases:
   - **Phase A (completed)**: Fix 6 critical issues from a codebase audit (XSS sanitization, error pages, property name bug, splice bug, Map.get null safety, security headers) on branch `fix/critical-issues`.
   - **Phase B (started but commit/PR not fully completed)**: Commit and PR the 6 critical fixes.
   - **Phase C (completed)**: Evaluate what the next big change should be after the PRs.
   - **Phase D (current)**: Combined i18n + accessibility feature on branch `feat/a11y-and-i18n`. User explicitly asked to "refactor what I have and remove the old stuff and do this as one joint effort" referring to the old i18n branch attempt and accessibility gaps. Plan was approved and implementation is in progress.

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - **Svelte 5 runes**: `rune<T>()` factory wrapping `$state()` — the canonical state primitive in this codebase
   - **Custom rune-based i18n**: A `t()` function that reads a `locale` rune, making all `{t("key")}` template expressions automatically reactive without stores or page reloads
   - **Flat dot-path message keys**: Organized by domain (nav.*, menu.*, home.*, course.*, etc.) for simple TypeScript typing via `keyof typeof en`
   - **Cookie-based locale persistence**: Readable server-side for SSR, with Accept-Language fallback
   - **prefers-reduced-motion**: A `prefersReducedMotion` rune that listens to `matchMedia` changes
   - **Skip-nav link**: First child of app shell, uses Tailwind `sr-only` + `focus:not-sr-only`
   - **ARIA landmarks**: `<nav aria-label>` wrappers, `role="navigation"`, `tabindex="-1"` on main
   - **Focus management**: `afterNavigate` → `document.getElementById("main-content")?.focus()`
   - **DOMPurify**: HTML sanitization for all `{@html}` instances (completed in critical fixes)
   - **SvelteKit hooks**: `sequence()` for chaining handle hooks, `handleError` for client/server
   - **Old i18n branch**: `origin/i18n_lgriffin_2024` used `sveltekit-i18n` v2.4.2 with Svelte 4 syntax, only covered 5 homepage components, used query-param locale + full page reloads — all being replaced

3. Files and Code Sections:

   **CRITICAL FIXES (branch `fix/critical-issues`, committed as `a32a6e3a`):**

   - `src/lib/utils/sanitize.ts` — **Created.** DOMPurify wrapper:
     ```typescript
     import DOMPurify from "dompurify";
     export function sanitizeHtml(html: string): string {
       return DOMPurify.sanitize(html);
     }
     ```
   - 11 `.svelte` files edited to import `sanitizeHtml` and wrap `{@html}` instances: `Card.svelte`, `Lab.svelte`, `Note.svelte`, `Video.svelte`, `Podcast.svelte`, `InfoButton.svelte`, `LoReference.svelte`, `search/+page.svelte`, `llm/+page.svelte`, `TutorsTerms.svelte`, `TutorsMessage.svelte`
   - `src/routes/+error.svelte` — **Created.** Styled error page using `page.status` and `page.error?.message`
   - `src/hooks.client.ts` — Added `HandleClientError` import and `handleError` export
   - `src/hooks.server.ts` — Added `Handle`, `HandleServerError`, `sequence` imports. Added `securityHeaders` handle and `handleError`. Changed export to `sequence(securityHeaders, authInitHandle)`
   - `localStorageProfile.ts`, `supabaseProfile.svelte.ts`, `CourseVisitCard.svelte` — Changed `.image` to `.img`
   - `course.svelte.ts` — Replaced `topic!` with `topic ?? course`, `wall!` with `wall ?? []`, `lo!` with `lo ?? course`
   - `live-lab.ts` — Replaced `!` assertions with `?? ""` fallbacks
   - `D:\code\tutors-generator\cli\tutors-gen-lib\src\services\resource-builder.ts` — Replaced `forEach+splice` with `filter()` in `pruneTree()`

   **I18N + A11Y (branch `feat/a11y-and-i18n`, in progress):**

   - `src/lib/services/i18n/index.ts` — **Created.** Core i18n service:
     ```typescript
     import { rune } from "$lib/runes.svelte";
     import en, { type MessageKey } from "./messages/en";
     import fr from "./messages/fr";
     import de from "./messages/de";
     import it from "./messages/it";
     import es from "./messages/es";

     export const SUPPORTED_LOCALES = ["en", "fr", "de", "it", "es"] as const;
     export type SupportedLocale = (typeof SUPPORTED_LOCALES)[number];
     export type { MessageKey };

     const messages: Record<SupportedLocale, Record<string, string>> = { en, fr, de, it, es };
     export const locale = rune<SupportedLocale>("en");

     export function t(key: MessageKey): string {
       return messages[locale.value]?.[key] ?? messages.en[key] ?? key;
     }

     export function setLocale(newLocale: SupportedLocale) {
       locale.value = newLocale;
       if (typeof document !== "undefined") {
         document.cookie = `locale=${newLocale};path=/;max-age=31536000;SameSite=Lax`;
         document.documentElement.lang = newLocale;
       }
     }

     export function initLocaleFromCookie(cookieHeader?: string): SupportedLocale {
       if (!cookieHeader) return "en";
       const match = cookieHeader.match(/(?:^|;\s*)locale=([a-z]{2})/);
       if (match && SUPPORTED_LOCALES.includes(match[1] as SupportedLocale)) {
         return match[1] as SupportedLocale;
       }
       return "en";
     }
     ```

   - `src/lib/services/i18n/messages/en.ts` — **Created.** ~90 English strings as flat dot-path keys with `MessageKey` type export. Keys organized by domain: `nav.*`, `menu.*`, `home.*`, `course.*`, `live.*`, `auth.*`, `time.*`, `content.*`, `footer.*`, `error.*`, `notFound.*`, `a11y.*`. Includes the long `auth.terms` text as a template literal.

   - `src/lib/services/i18n/messages/fr.ts` — **Created.** Full French translations, ported from old branch + new keys. Typed as `Record<string, string>`.

   - `src/lib/services/i18n/messages/de.ts` — **Created.** Full German translations.

   - `src/lib/services/i18n/messages/it.ts` — **Created.** Full Italian translations.

   - `src/lib/services/i18n/messages/es.ts` — **Created.** Full Spanish translations.

   - `src/lib/services/a11y/reduced-motion.svelte.ts` — **Created:**
     ```typescript
     import { browser } from "$app/environment";
     import { rune } from "$lib/runes.svelte";

     function getReducedMotion(): boolean {
       if (!browser) return false;
       return window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
     }

     export const prefersReducedMotion = rune(getReducedMotion());

     if (browser) {
       const mql = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)");
       mql.addEventListener("change", (e) => {
         prefersReducedMotion.value = e.matches;
       });
     }
     ```

   - `src/lib/ui/TutorsShell.svelte` — **Modified.** Added imports for `prefersReducedMotion` and `t`. Added skip-nav link, `id="main-content"` + `tabindex="-1"` on `<main>`, `outline-none` class, `aria-label` on footer, reduced-motion-aware durations on fly/slide transitions.

   - `src/lib/ui/navigators/MainNavigator.svelte` — **Modified.** Added `t` import. Wrapped `<AppBar>` in `<nav aria-label={t("a11y.mainNavigation")}>`.

   - `src/lib/ui/navigators/buttons/Breadcrumbs.svelte` — **Modified.** Added `t` import. Wrapped content in `<nav aria-label={t("a11y.breadcrumbs")}>`.

   - `src/lib/ui/navigators/SecondaryNavigator.svelte` — **Modified.** Added `t` import. Added `role="navigation" aria-label={t("a11y.secondaryNavigation")}` to root div.

   - `src/routes/(course-reader)/+layout.svelte` — **Modified.** Added `document.getElementById("main-content")?.focus()` after scroll in `afterNavigate`.

   - `src/lib/ui/navigators/animations.ts` — **Modified.** Imported `prefersReducedMotion`. Refactored `scaleTransition`, `slideFromLeft`, `slideFromRight` to use getters that return 0 duration/no movement when reduced motion is enabled.

   - `src/routes/+layout.svelte` — **Read but not yet modified.** Current state:
     ```svelte
     <script lang="ts">
       import "../app.css";
       import { tutorsConnectService } from "$lib/services/connect";
       import type { PageData } from "./$types";
       import { browser } from "$app/environment";
       import { themeService } from "$lib/services/themes/services/themes.svelte";
       interface Props {
         data: PageData;
         children: import("svelte").Snippet;
       }
       let { data, children }: Props = $props();
       if (data?.user) {
         tutorsConnectService.reconnect(data.user);
       }
       if (browser) {
         themeService.initDisplay();
       }
     </script>
     {@render children()}
     ```
     Needs: `$effect` for `document.documentElement.lang = locale.value` and locale initialization from server data.

   - `src/lib/runes.svelte.ts` — The rune factory and existing runes (read, not modified):
     ```typescript
     export const rune = <T>(initialValue: T) => {
       let _rune = $state(initialValue);
       return {
         get value() { return _rune; },
         set value(v: T) { _rune = v; }
       };
     };
